# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command callers
usage 1   callers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]
usage 2                                 find instructions statically calling/jumping to <addr>,
usage 3                                 scanning CpuBus (default: <addr>'s own bank, $8000-$FFFF)

case static calls on the fake target
target fake
covers 1-3
$ callers
out 45
Usage: callers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]
status 0
action none
$ callers 8010
out 20
  $008000: JSR $8010
status 0
action none
$ callers 8000
out 20
  $008009: JMP $8000
status 0
action none
$ callers 8010 8000 10
out 20
  $008000: JSR $8010
status 0
action none
$ callers 1234
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $001234 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ label add 8010 sub
out 21
$008010 is now 'sub'.
status 0
action none
$ callers 8010
out 20
  $008000: JSR $8010
status 0
action none
$ callers zz
out 46
Error: Could not find any recognizable digits.
status 1
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ callers 8000
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case on venusrt
target venusrt
covers 1-3
$ callers 8000
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $008000 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ callers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on moon
target moon
covers 1-3
$ callers 8000
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $008000 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ callers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on mercuryrt
target mercuryrt
covers 1-3
$ callers 8000
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $008000 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ callers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end

case on nephrite
target nephrite
covers 1-3
$ callers 8000
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $008000 found in $008000-$00FFFF.
status 0
action none
$ callers 0 0 100
out 67
No statically-resolvable calls of $000000 found in $000000-$0000FF.
status 0
action none
end
